:"grp_performance"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_fp16_accumulation","name":"enable_fp16_accumulation","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_fp16_accumulation"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sage_attention","name":"sage_attention","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sage_attention"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"chunks","name":"chunks","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"chunks"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"clear_models_and_cache","name":"clear_models_and_cache","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"clear_models_and_cache"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"grp_preview","name":"grp_preview","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"grp_preview"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_preview","name":"enable_preview","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_preview"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"text_prompt(s)","name":"text_prompt(s)","type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"av_latent","name":"av_latent","type":"LATENT","links":null},{"localized_name":"video_latent","name":"video_latent","type":"LATENT","links":null},{"localized_name":"audio_latent","name":"audio_latent","type":"LATENT","links":null},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null},{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":[635]},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[636]},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","links":[637]},{"localized_name":"ref_frame_count","name":"ref_frame_count","type":"INT","links":null},{"localized_name":"real_time_eta","name":"real_time_eta","type":"ETA_TRACKER","links":[638]}],"properties":{"aux_id":"triXope/ComfyUI-triXope","ver":"f8a2dd5b06adb1db81bc6c24a746b6d9e554289c","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"},"Node name for S&R":"FilmAuteur_LTXV","groupState_grp_mode":false,"groupState_grp_prompting":false,"groupState_grp_specs":false,"groupState_grp_sampling":false,"groupState_grp_refinement":false,"groupState_grp_performance":false,"groupState_grp_preview":true},"widgets_values":["▼ Mode Select","text",0.7,0,"source",3,"▼ Prompting","Lin: This young woman of East Asian descent has a fair, smooth complexion, dark eyes, straight brows, and delicate facial features set in a stern, intensely focused expression. Her straight, jet-black hair is pulled back tightly into a high ponytail, with fine, wet wisps clinging to her temples, jawline, and the nape of her neck, while her noticeably damp skin glistens with moisture. She is clad in a soaked, light teal-blue, long-sleeved garment made of a heavily textured, slightly shimmering material that clings to her shoulders and arms, revealing glimpses of a darker layer near the neckline. Her hands and lower wrists are fully encased in thick, dark charcoal, distressed gloves made of a rough, worn material, and her fingers are wrapped tightly around the dark, diamond-patterned braided hilt of a traditional katana, which features a circular metallic hand guard and a gleaming steel blade.","Crimson Lantern Alley: The environment is enveloped in a thick, cool-toned blue haze that obscures the deeper background and creates a moody, atmospheric nighttime setting. The air is visibly damp and misty, suggesting an ongoing downpour or heavy precipitation in the immediate surroundings. Piercing through the pervasive, smoky cyan fog are several softly glowing, traditional red paper lanterns suspended in the distance, casting warm, diffused crimson halos that starkly contrast with the ambient cool lighting. The extreme shallow depth of field renders the physical boundaries and architectural details of the space as an indistinct blur, leaving only a dramatic, wet backdrop defined entirely by the intense, cinematic interplay of deep azure mist and luminous ruby-red light.","A tight close-up shot opens on a heavily misted, rain-soaked alleyway at night, where a thick, cool-toned blue haze rolls across the frame and obscures the deep background. Softly glowing, traditional red paper lanterns hang suspended in the distant background, cutting through the smoky cyan fog to cast warm, diffused crimson halos into the downpour. Lin, a young woman of East Asian descent, stands firmly in the foreground, water glistening across her fair, smooth complexion as rain drips from the fine, wet wisps of her jet-black high ponytail. She wears a soaked, light teal-blue, long-sleeved garment made of a heavily textured, slightly shimmering material that clings tightly to her shoulders and arms. Her hands, encased in thick, dark charcoal distressed gloves, tightly grip the diamond-patterned braided hilt of a traditional katana, pointing the gleaming steel blade forward. Her jaw clenches as she inhales sharply, her chest rising and falling against the wet fabric. Tracking a sudden movement to her right, she rotates her head and torso together naturally, maintaining realistic alignment of her spine and neck as she shifts her weight. She lifts the katana higher into a defensive guard, sending a spray of water droplets slicing through the damp air from the metallic hand guard. A handheld camera pushes in slowly on her face, capturing the dramatic interplay of the dominant cool azure ambient light and the flickering ruby-red rim light reflecting off her wet skin and the steel blade. The natural environment fills with the heavy, persistent ambient sound of pouring rain splashing against the unseen cobblestones, layered with the sharp, metallic swish of the katana cutting through the air, featuring no background music to ensure the scene remains cinematic, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, photorealistic, masterpiece, maintains realistic human anatomy and natural joint rotation throughout. |\nA dynamic medium tracking shot captures the immediate continuation of the action in the rain-soaked Crimson Lantern Alley, where the thick, cool-toned blue haze and pervasive downpour blur the slick cobblestone ground and distant background architecture. Softly glowing red paper lanterns hang suspended in the foggy distance, casting warm, diffused crimson halos that cut through the dominant cool cyan atmosphere and glisten on the wet surfaces. Lin, wearing her soaked, light teal-blue heavily textured garment and dark charcoal distressed gloves, springs forward from her defensive stance, her wet jet-black high ponytail snapping with the sudden movement. She executes a powerful horizontal slash with the traditional katana, driving the gleaming steel blade from the left side of the frame toward the right in a wide arc that slices through the falling rain. Her hips rotate first to drive the motion, followed smoothly by her torso and shoulders to maintain natural spine alignment and realistic anatomy as the blade cuts through the misty air. Water droplets explode in a fine spray off the braided hilt and hilt wrap with the force of the strike. Handheld tracking movement follows her advance, capturing the tension in her wet facial features and the dynamic recoil of the sword. The dominant cool azure lighting contrasts sharply with the brief crimson flares reflected off the blade as it passes near the distant lanterns. The natural environment fills with the heavy ambient sound of persistent rain splashing against cobblestones, layered with the sharp swish of the katana cutting through the air and the scuff of her boots gripping the wet stone, featuring no background music to ensure the scene remains cinematic, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, photorealistic, masterpiece, maintains realistic human anatomy and natural joint rotation throughout. |\nA close-up (macro) shot focusing intently on Lin's dark, distressed leather gloves tightly gripping the diamond-patterned hilt of the traditional katana, where the intense wet texture of the leather contrasts with the smooth, gleaming steel blade slicing horizontally through the dense blue mist. The environment remains enveloped in the cool cyan haze, with the distant red lanterns blurred into soft, glowing crimson bokeh. Rain runs down the fuller of the blade, glistening under the light as Lin holds a tense, powerful pose, shifting her weight subtly forward. Following an unseen block, she rapidly adjusts her grip and executes a quick, low thrust toward the center of the frame, driving the point of the katana forward with concentrated force. Her core muscles and shoulders engage to stabilize the thrust, ensuring realistic postural control and biomechanics as her torso moves naturally with the strike. Water droplets cling to her skin and the intricate braided hilt wrap, catching the light as she exhales in a controlled burst of breath. A slow dolly-in pushes closer to the hilt and her knuckles, highlighting the strain in her fingers before rack focusing to the sharp point of the blade. Lighting is diffused and moody, with a strong cool ambient blue tone punctuated by brief red highlights reflecting dynamically on the wet metal and leather from the distant lanterns. The constant ambient sound of heavy rain and distant thunder creates the natural environment, layered with the sharp scrape-clink of metal deflecting against unseen metal and Lin's short, forceful exhalation, featuring no background music to ensure the scene remains cinematic, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, photorealistic, masterpiece, maintains realistic human anatomy and natural joint rotation throughout. |\nA wide establishing shot opens on the desolate, rain-drenched Crimson Lantern Alley, where the pervasive, cool-toned blue fog deepens the shadows and obscures the buildings receding into the distance. Numerous traditional red paper lanterns glow softly and hang suspended throughout the background, their warm crimson light bleeding into the dense cyan haze and reflecting dramatically in the large, ripple-marked puddles covering the cobblestones below. Lin stands solitary and still in the center-left foreground, her wet, light teal-blue garment clinging to her figure, her black high ponytail heavy with water, and the point of her traditional katana lowered slowly toward the wet ground. She takes a deep, controlled breath, her chest rising and falling visibly in the chilly air, as she releases her white-knuckled tension on the hilt, allowing the sword to hang casually. After a moment, she shifts her gaze from the deep alleyway toward the right, slowly rotating her head and neck in a natural motion that allows her shoulders to relax while maintaining correct spinal alignment and posture. Wiping a gloved hand across her wet brow, she begins to walk slowly away from the camera and down the misty alley toward the distant red lights. Handheld tracking pulls back and drifts slightly upward, expanding the frame to show the vast, empty, rain-soaked location surrounding the solitary figure. Diffused blue and red light mixes throughout the atmosphere, creating a moody, desaturated color palette punctuated by intense bursts of crimson reflection. The natural environment is dominated by the overwhelming ambient sound of persistent, pouring rain and water splashing from the eaves, layered with Lin's slow, heavy exhalation and the faint, wet scuff of her boots on the stones, featuring no background music to ensure the scene remains cinematic, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, photorealistic, masterpiece, maintains realistic human anatomy and natural joint rotation throughout.",false,"http://127.0.0.1:11434","gemma4:26b","▼ Video Specs",0,"randomize",1792,768,5,24,"▼ Primary Sampling","euler",1,"1.0, 0.99375, 0.9875, 0.98125, 0.975, 0.909375, 0.881203, 0.863321, 0.841251, 0.820089, 0.655, 0.381875, 0.0",0.5,true,true,true,30,10,"▼ Upscale & Refine",true,2,"euler_cfg_pp",1.5,"0.55, 0.35, 0.15, 0.0",true,0.25,true,"codeformer.pth","retinaface_resnet50",0.5,true,true,0.3,"▼ Performance",true,"disabled",4,true,"▼ Preview",true],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":170,"type":"ColorFX","pos":[4930,2990],"size":[290,300],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"